  <metadata>
    <name>Saldus: Kalnsētas parks un Cieceres taka</name>
    <desc>Published complete walking circuit through Kalnsetas park, riverside and Saldus town. About 1.83 km (18.53%) follows the separately listed Ciecere trail; about 8.03 km is additional ground. Track by Roberts Greitāns. All coordinates preserved from the public Outdooractive GeoShape line, retrieved 2026-09-05; no interpolation or guessed connections. This is the public map representation, not the login-gated GPX export.</desc>
    <link href="https://www.outdooractive.com/en/route/city-walk/saldus-novads/saldus-kalnsetas-parks-un-cieceres-taka/332630255/" />
  </metadata>
